        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2012 Mosby, Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "A 33 year old woman with human immune deficiency virus presented to the emergency room for the evaluation of abdominal pain. At laparotomy, she was found to have bilateral ovarian torsion. On final pathology, bilateral ovaries were found to be involved with Burkitt's lymphoma."
